      "role": "user",
      "content": "I'm a bit confused by your comparison. Why did you bring up goblins in a discussion about archival classification systems? I'm looking for a professional assessment for a university setting, not analogies. Can you please stick to the technical aspects of the LCC and Dewey systems regarding the manuscript collection?",
